me><given-names>PE</given-names></name><name><surname>George</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Larsson</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Lally</surname><given-names>ET</given-names></name><name><surname>Taichman</surname><given-names>NS</given-names></name><name><surname>Norhagen</surname><given-names>EG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Oral and systemic immunoglobulin G-subclass antibodies to <italic>Actinobacillus actinomycetemcomitans </italic>leukotoxin</article-title><source>Oral Microbiol Immunol</source><year>1999</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>104</fpage><lpage>108</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10219169</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1034/j.1399-302X.1999.140205.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Javed</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Sundin</surname><given-names>U</given-names></name><name><surname>Altamash</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Klinge</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Engstr&#x000f6;m</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Self-perceived oral health and salivary proteins in children with type 1 diabetes</article-title><source>J Oral Rehabil</source><year>2009</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>39</fpage><lpage>44</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18976260</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2842.2008.01895.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sandholm</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Tolo</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Olsen</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Salivary IgG, a parameter of periodontal disease activity? High responders to <italic>Actinobacillus actinomycetemcomitans </italic>Y4 in juvenile and adult periodontitis</article-title><source>J Clin Periodontol</source><year>1987</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>289</fpage><lpage>294</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">3475296</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1600-051X.1987.tb01535.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Anil</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Remani</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Beena</surname><given-names>VT</given-names></name><name><surname>Nair</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Vijayakumar</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Immunoglobulins in the saliva of diabetic patients with periodontitis</article-title><source>Ann Dent</source><year>1995</year><volume>54</volume><fpage>30</fpage><lpage>33</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8572541</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Javed</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Altamash</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Klinge</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Engstr&#x000f6;m</surname><given-names>PE</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Periodontal conditions and oral symptoms in <italic>gutka-chewers </italic>with and without type 2 diabetes</article-title><source>Acta Odontol Scand</source><year>2008</year><volume>66</volume><fpage>268</fpage><lpage>273</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18645686</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1080/00016350802286725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Addy</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Renton-Harper</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Local and systemic chemotherapy in the management of periodontal disease: an opinion and review of the concept</article-title><source>J Oral Rehabil</source><year>1996</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>219</fpage><lpage>231</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8730268</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1365-2842.1996.tb00845.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kadir</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Pisiriciler</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Aky&#x000fc;z</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Yarat</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Emekli</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Ipb&#x000fc;ker</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Mycological and cytological examination of oral candidal carriage in diabetic patients and non-diabetic control subjects: thorough analysis of local aetiologic and systemic factors</article-title><source>J Oral Rehabil</source><year>2002</year><volume>29</volume><fpage>452</fpage><lpage>457</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12028493</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1046/j.1365-2842.2002.00837.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Scavini</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Stidley</surname><given-names>CA</given-names></name><name><surname>Shah</surname><given-names>VO</given-names></name><name><surname>Narva</surname><given-names>AS</given-names></name><name><surname>Tentori</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Kessler</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Bobelu</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Albert</surname><given-names>CP</given-names></name><name><surname>Bobelu</surname><given-names>J</given-nam